---
// Setup notice shown at /admin while the embedded Sanity Studio is disabled
// (no SANITY_PROJECT_ID). When the Studio IS enabled, @sanity/astro owns the
// /admin route, so getStaticPaths returns [] here and this file emits nothing —
// no route collision. import.meta.env.SANITY_PROJECT_ID is injected by the
// vite.define in astro.config.mjs.
export function getStaticPaths() {
  const id = import.meta.env.SANITY_PROJECT_ID;
  const studioEnabled = !!id && id !== 'placeholder';
  return studioEnabled ? [] : [{ params: { slug: undefined } }];
}
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Sanity Studio — Cần cấu hình</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: dark; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body {
        font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
        color: #f4efe9;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(240,169,111,0.16), transparent 22%),
          linear-gradient(135deg, #06070b, #121521 60%, #090b12);
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .notice {
        max-width: 640px;
        width: 100%;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 40px;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.22em;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: #f0a96f;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }
      h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 14px; }
      p { color: #b6b0a8; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 18px; }
      ol { color: #b6b0a8; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
      code {
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 2px 7px;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        color: #ffd9b8;
      }
      a { color: #f0a96f; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="notice">
      <span class="badge">Sanity Studio</span>
      <h1>Studio chưa được bật</h1>
      <p>
        Biến môi trường <code>SANITY_PROJECT_ID</code> đang trống, nên trang quản trị
        nhúng tạm thời bị tắt (tránh lỗi trắng trang khi Studio cố kết nối tới một
        project không tồn tại). Toàn bộ website vẫn chạy bình thường bằng dữ liệu mẫu.
      </p>
      <p>Để bật Studio:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Lấy <strong>Project ID</strong> tại <a href="https://sanity.io/manage" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sanity.io/manage</a> (hoặc chạy <code>npx sanity@latest init</code>).</li>
        <li>Điền vào file <code>.env</code>: <code>SANITY_PROJECT_ID=your-id</code>.</li>
        <li>Thêm CORS origin <code>http://localhost:4321</code> (và domain production) trong Sanity dashboard → API, bật <em>Allow credentials</em>.</li>
        <li>Chạy lại <code>npm run dev</code> — Studio sẽ tự động hiện tại <code>/admin</code>.</li>
      </ol>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
